# Normalise line endings to LF everywhere.
#
# This is not cosmetic. The server files in this repo are deployed to Linux —
# systemd units and shell scripts break outright on CRLF, and a Windows checkout
# with core.autocrlf=true would otherwise hand them back with CRLF endings. LF in
# the repository and LF in the working tree keeps what is deployed identical to
# what is committed, on either operating system.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files must never be touched by end-of-line conversion.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
